  "instructions": [
    "Cook the low-glycemic noodles according to the package instructions and set aside.",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the shrimp and cook for 2-3 minutes until pink and fully cooked.",
    "Add the Korean chili paste and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the bonito flakes and cook for 1 minute until combined.",
    "Add the cooked noodles to the skillet and stir to combine with the shrimp and sauce.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Transfer the noodles to a serving dish and garnish with green onions and sesame seeds."
